test/operations/schedule_split_reduce.ml -- `(x % 5)`: the remainder only scales a sin/cos term that already varies with every cell; the value is not a function of the key
test/operations/wrap_prec_convert.ml -- `(i % 5)`: the remainder only scales a sin/cos term that already varies with every cell; the value is not a function of the key
